  "Unanimous (1 name): mvp 2019 Lamar Jackson (50/50), droy 2021 Micah Parsons (50/50).",
  "Ties in vote count, listed in PFR table order: mvp 2016 Carr/Elliott (6 each, 3rd); opoy 2018 Gurley/Hopkins (2 each); opoy 2019 Mahomes/Wilson (1 each); opoy 2020 Mahomes/Rodgers (5 each) and Allen/Kelce (3 each); dpoy 2017 Jordan/Lawrence tied at 1 with Xavier Rhodes, Harrison Smith, Bobby Wagner (4th-5th slots arbitrary among five); dpoy 2019 Donald tied at 1 with Danielle Hunter and Tre'Davious White (5th slot arbitrary); coy 2017 Belichick/Pederson (1 each); coy 2019 McDermott/Tomlin (2 each).",
  "Ties in points (2022+): coy 2023 Stefanski and DeMeco Ryans both 165 points, Stefanski won on first-place votes; Harbaugh/Shanahan both 26 points; droy 2022 Jalen Pitre tied for 5th with Sam Williams (1 point each).",
